---
const features = [
  ['Tile your terminals', 'Keep multiple sessions in view and move between them quickly.'],
  ['Add local apps', 'Run small local apps alongside your terminals.'],
  ['Bring your agents', 'Run the coding agents you already use in the same workspace.'],
];
---
<div class="product-strip">Terminals / Local apps / Coding agents</div>
<section class="intro wrap" id="product" aria-labelledby="product-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Features</p><h2 id="product-title">What Plexi includes.</h2></div>
  <div><p class="intro-lede">Open the tools you use in one desktop window.</p>
    {features.map(([title, copy], i) => <div class="detail"><span class="num">0{i + 1}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></div></div>)}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="statement" aria-labelledby="local-title"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Local software</p><h2 id="local-title">Runs<br />on your<br />computer.</h2><div class="statement-bottom"><p>Plexi runs locally. Work with files on your computer in formats you can inspect.</p><a href="/docs">Read the documentation ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="founder wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">From the founder</p><h2 id="founder-title">Ian Burke</h2><p class="founder-role">Founder of Plexi</p></div>
  <div><blockquote>“Plexi takes the speed limit off your computer. I can have four terminals researching different things, turn that work into reports and dashboards, make a decision, and act on it without leaving the app.”</blockquote><p class="origin">I wanted to move between agents and apps as fast as I wanted to move. I'd pushed macOS as far as I could and tried Linux. Plexi came out of that: one Rust app, with the goal of giving me nearly the same workspace on Mac, Windows, and Linux.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="docs-preview wrap" aria-labelledby="reference-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Reference</p><h2 id="reference-title">Docs.</h2></div><div><p>Installation, setup, and reference for Plexi.</p><a href="/docs">Read the docs ↗</a></div></section>
<style>
  section { padding-block: var(--space-section); }
  .product-strip { padding: 22px 36px; background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--bg); font: 900 clamp(22px, 3.8vw, 62px)/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.055em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .intro, .founder, .docs-preview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 8vw; }
  h2 { font-weight: 750; margin-top: 22px; max-width: 11ch; font-size: clamp(49px, 6.5vw, 102px); line-height: .94; letter-spacing: -.075em; }
  .intro-lede { margin-bottom: 58px; max-width: 35ch; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 39px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .detail { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; gap: 25px; padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .num { color: var(--accent-light); font: 700 13px var(--mono); }
  h3 { font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(22px, 2vw, 30px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.045em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .detail p { color: var(--fg-2); font-size: 16px; max-width: 47ch; }
  .statement { background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--bg); }
  .statement .eyebrow { color: var(--bg); }
  .statement h2 { font: 900 clamp(64px, 10.8vw, 173px)/.85 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .statement-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 35px; margin-top: 55px; padding-top: 25px; border-top: 1px solid currentColor; }
  .statement-bottom p { max-width: 40ch; font-size: 20px; }
  .statement-bottom a, .docs-preview a { display: inline-block; padding-block: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; font-weight: 700; }
  .founder h2 { font-size: clamp(44px, 4.6vw, 70px); }
  .founder-role { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--fg-2); font: 13px var(--mono); }
  blockquote { font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 46px); font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.17; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .origin { margin-top: 44px; padding-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--fg-2); font-size: 18px; }
  .docs-preview h2 { font-family: var(--display); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .docs-preview p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: clamp(22px, 2.3vw, 34px); max-width: 32ch; line-height: 1.18; margin-bottom: 35px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .intro, .founder, .docs-preview { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 50px; }
    .detail { grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .statement h2 { font-size: 11vw; }
    .statement-bottom { display: block; }
    .statement-bottom a { margin-top: 22px; }
    .product-strip { padding-inline: 18px; }
  }
</style>
